  "gaps": [],
  "prose": {
    "summary": "Ultralight CMS is modeled as one #ABS abstraction containing four #FILE Nodes. index.html owns the page-request Event. The Event is explicitly bound to renderer.js FUNCTION_QUERY, which consumes content.json and style.css data surfaces. FUNCTION_QUERY calls FUNCTION_RENDER, and FUNCTION_RENDER exposes the rendered index document as output.",
    "notes": "This revision intentionally fixes canonical Function and Event ownership before any renderer animation behavior is changed. Dependency direction is structural: content.json/style.css -> renderer.js -> index.html by dependency parent_ref -> child_ref semantics. Event, handler and function-call semantics remain explicit separate canonical Links."
  }
